-- =====================================================================
-- Session 140 — Matt 11 extras-tier cross-references (single chapter)
-- =====================================================================
-- Adds Matt 11's extras-tier rows + threads to the cross-reference
-- corpus. Continues the S131 (Matt 1-2), S132 (Matt 3), S133 (Matt 4),
-- S134 (Matt 5), S135 (Matt 6), S137 (Matt 7-8 paired), S138 (Matt 9),
-- and S139 (Matt 10) extras-tier coverage. Single chapter migration —
-- Matt 11 is dense framework ground (Yochanan's (John's) prison-question
-- and the Isaiah-credential answer at vv.2-6; the *more than a prophet*
-- testimony of Yochanan (John) with the Malachi 3:1 implicit-Christology
-- at v.10 and the inaugural-Eliyahu-pattern at vv.13-14; the children-
-- in-the-marketplaces diagnostic of the system's-prior-decision-against-
-- hearing at vv.16-19; the graduated-accountability woes upon Korazin,
-- Beit-Tsaida (Bethsaida), and Kfar-Nachum (Capernaum) at vv.20-24; the
-- Father-Son revelation-economy prayer at vv.25-27 naming the Formless-
-- Formed nature-of-God reading explicitly; and the *come unto me ... my
-- yoke is easy* invitation at vv.28-30 as the chapter's second framework-
-- major moment).
--
-- Matt 11 reading-target: the chapter is the transitional chapter
-- between the Matt 10 commissioning and the Matt 12 Shabbat-controversies,
-- with the second-half framework-major weight landing at the Father-Son
-- revelation-economy (vv.25-27) and the heart-Torah-yoke invitation
-- (vv.28-30). The extras-library carries multiple direct verbal-anchors:
-- Sirach 48:10's Eliyahu *to restore the tribes of Jacob* twelve-tribe
-- substance for vv.13-14; Sirach 3:18-20's *mysteries are revealed to
-- the meek* for vv.25; 1 Enoch 46-51's *Son of Man / Elect One* named-
-- before-the-Head-of-Days for vv.25-27; Sirach 51:23-27's *put your neck
-- under the yoke ... I have but little labour, and have gotten to me
-- much rest* for vv.28-30 (the strongest extras verbal-anchor in the
-- entire library for the Matt 11:28-30 invitation).
--
-- Eleven Hebrew-library threads track the chapter's framework moves at
-- the restoration-not-innovation register:
--   * The prophet's-question-from-distress under the inaugurated-but-
--     not-yet tension at vv.2-3, v.6 — 4 Ezra (2 Esdras) 4:33-37's
--     *how, and when shall these things come to pass? wherefore are
--     our years few and evil?* prophet-questions to the angel Uriel
--     about the timing-of-the-end and the souls-of-the-righteous-in-
--     their-chambers-asking-how-long.
--   * The Messianic-age-credentialing at v.5 — 1 Enoch 5:7-9 (the
--     elect-receive-peace-protection-and-prosper-with-wisdom), 1 Enoch
--     10:17-22 (latter-day-restoration with all-children-of-men-shall-
--     become-righteous and earth-cleansed-from-all-defilement),
--     Jubilees 23:27-29 (latter-day-renewal with no-Satan-no-evil-
--     destroyer and days-of-blessing-and-healing).
--   * The Eliyahu-pattern with the *restore the tribes of Jacob* twelve-
--     tribe-gathering substance at v.10, vv.13-14 — Sirach 48:10's
--     direct verbal-anchor *ordained for reproofs in their times, to
--     pacify the wrath of the judgment of Yahuah (God) ... to turn the
--     heart of the father to the son, and to restore the tribes of
--     Jacob*; 1 Maccabees 2:58's *Elias for being zealous and fervent
--     for the law was taken up into heaven* (the wisdom-stream witness
--     to the Eliyahu-zealous-for-Torah architecture).
--   * The new-heart-substance of the kingdom-citizens at v.11 — Jubilees
--     1:23-25's direct articulation of the new-heart promise: *I shall
--     circumcise the foreskin of their heart ... I shall create in them
--     a holy spirit ... they will fulfil My commandments, and I shall
--     be their Father and they will be My children* — the wisdom-stream
--     Tanakh-anchor parallel to Jeremiah 31:33 and Ezekiel 36:26-27.
--   * The wise-laying-in-wait-for-the-righteous at v.6, vv.16-19 —
--     Wisdom of Solomon 2:12-20's direct wisdom-stream prophecy of the
--     system's-rejection-of-the-righteous-one: *let us lie in wait for
--     the righteous ... let us condemn him with a shameful death.*
--   * The wisdom-mother of her children *come unto me, fill yourselves*
--     at v.19 — Sirach 24:19-22's *come unto me, all you that be
--     desirous of me, and fill yourselves with my fruits* and Baruch
--     3:36-37 / 4:1 naming the wisdom *given to Yashar'el (Israel)
--     his beloved* and *the book of the commandments of Yahuah (God),
--     and the law that endureth for ever.*
--   * The graduated-judgment-of-the-credentialed at vv.20-24 — Wisdom
--     of Solomon 6:5-8's *a sharp judgment shall be to them that be in
--     high places ... mighty men shall be mightily tormented.*
--   * The Sodom-as-judgment-archetype at vv.23-24 — Jubilees 16:5-9's
--     direct Sodom-destruction-narrative and Wisdom of Solomon 10:6-8's
--     *the waste land that smoketh is a testimony, and ... a standing
--     pillar of salt is a monument of an unbelieving soul.*
--   * The Son-of-Adam / Elect-One named-before-the-Head-of-Days
--     revealing-mysteries architecture at vv.25-27 — 1 Enoch 46:1-3's
--     *Son of Adam who hath righteousness ... revealeth all the
--     treasures of that which is hidden*; 1 Enoch 48:6-7's *for this
--     reason hath he been chosen and hidden before Him, Before the
--     creation of the world ... the wisdom of Yahuah (God) of Spirits
--     hath revealed him to the holy and righteous*; 1 Enoch 51:3's
--     *the Elect One shall in those days sit on My throne, And his
--     mouth shall pour forth all the secrets of wisdom and counsel.*
--   * The mysteries-revealed-to-the-meek-not-to-the-mighty at v.25 —
--     Sirach 3:18-20's direct verbal-anchor *many are in high place,
--     and of renown: but mysteries are revealed to the meek* and
--     Wisdom of Solomon 7:7's *I prayed, and understanding was given
--     me: I called upon Yahuah (God), and the spirit of wisdom came
--     to me.*
--   * The *come unto me, put your neck under the yoke, find rest* at
--     vv.28-30 — Sirach 51:23-27's THE strongest verbal-anchor in the
--     entire extras-library: *draw near to me, you unlearned ... put
--     your neck under the yoke ... behold with your eyes, how that I
--     have but little labour, and have gotten to me much rest*; Sirach
--     6:24-31's *put your feet into her fetters, and your neck into
--     her chain ... at the last you shall find her rest*; Sirach
--     24:19's *come to me, all you that be desirous of me.*
--
-- Editions used at S140: Apocrypha KJV 1611 (`apocrypha` — Sirach /
-- Ecclesiasticus, Wisdom of Solomon, 1 Maccabees, 2 Esdras / 4 Ezra,
-- Baruch with the Letter of Jeremiah), 1 Enoch (`enoch`), Jubilees
-- (`jubilees`). The pseudepigrapha edition is not used at S140 (Matt 11
-- readings do not surface a framework-bearing connection from 4 Maccabees,
-- 2 Baruch, Testaments of XII, 2 Enoch, or Adam-Eve at the rigour the
-- migration requires beyond what the apocrypha / 1 Enoch / Jubilees
-- threads already carry). Sonnini's Acts of Paul, Ascension of Isaiah,
-- Apocalypse of Abraham, and Adam-Eve Conflict do not surface
-- framework-bearing Matt 11 connections at S140. Historical-witness
-- editions (Josephus, M.R. James's apocryphal NT, Lightfoot's Apostolic
-- Fathers) remain deferred from V1 cross-refs per the historical-witness
-- one-way rule. The lookup view retains the full S139 edition set for
-- forward compatibility.
--
-- Eleven PROPOSED threads at extras-tier:
--   1.  `prophets-question-in-the-inaugurated-tension-in-4-ezra-4`         (sort 260)
--   2.  `messianic-age-restoration-in-1-enoch-and-jubilees-23`             (sort 261)
--   3.  `eliyahu-to-restore-the-tribes-in-sirach-48-and-1-maccabees-2`     (sort 262)
--   4.  `new-heart-cleansing-spirit-children-of-the-living-in-jubilees-1`  (sort 263)
--   5.  `wise-laying-in-wait-for-the-righteous-in-wisdom-of-solomon-2`     (sort 264)
--   6.  `wisdom-come-unto-me-fill-yourselves-in-sirach-24-and-baruch-3-4`  (sort 265)
--   7.  `mighty-men-mightily-tormented-in-wisdom-of-solomon-6`             (sort 266)
--   8.  `sodom-as-judgment-archetype-in-jubilees-16-and-wisdom-10`         (sort 267)
--   9.  `the-son-of-adam-elect-one-revealing-mysteries-in-1-enoch-46-51`   (sort 268)
--   10. `mysteries-revealed-to-the-meek-in-sirach-3-and-wisdom-of-solomon` (sort 269)
--   11. `put-your-neck-under-the-yoke-find-rest-in-sirach-51-and-6-and-24` (sort 270)
--
-- 35 new cross_references rows, all at tier_required='extras'. Every
-- member-note passes the 12 Red Lines and the 12-point editorial
-- checklist. Hebrew names with internal apostrophes (Yashar'el,
-- Ya'aqov, Yechezk'el, Yo'el, Ya'ir, Sha'ul, etc.) are escaped per
-- SQL single-quoted-string-literal convention (every internal '
-- doubled to '').
--
-- Idempotent: ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING on every INSERT.
-- =====================================================================

\echo 'Session 140 — Matt 11 extras-tier cross-references migration starting...'
BEGIN;

-- Verse-lookup temp view. Mirrors the S139 view including
-- `sonnini-acts-29`; retained for forward compatibility even though
-- Matt 11 does not surface a Sonnini Acts 29 connection at S140.
CREATE TEMP VIEW _s140_verse_lookup AS
SELECT
    e.slug AS edition_slug,
    b.slug AS book_slug,
    c.chapter_number,
    v.verse_number,
    v.id AS verse_id
  FROM verses v
  JOIN chapters c ON v.chapter_id = c.id
  JOIN books    b ON c.book_id    = b.id
  JOIN editions e ON b.edition_id = e.id
 WHERE e.slug IN (
       'canon',
       'enoch',
       'jubilees',
       'jasher',
       'apocrypha',
       'apocrypha-charles-vol1',
       'pseudepigrapha',
       'adam-eve-conflict',
       'apocalypse-of-abraham',
       'ascension-isaiah',
       'sonnini-acts-29'
   );

-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Insert 35 extras-tier cross_references rows.
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------
WITH input(src_edition, src_slug, src_ch, src_v,
           tgt_edition, tgt_slug, tgt_ch, tgt_v, note) AS (VALUES

  -- Thread 1: prophets-question-in-the-inaugurated-tension-in-4-ezra-4
  ('canon', 'matthew', 11, 3, 'apocrypha', '2-esdras', 4, 33,
   '*Then I answered and said, How, and when shall these things come to pass? wherefore are our years few and evil?* 2 Esdras (4 Ezra) 4:33 names the wisdom-stream''s direct architecture of the prophet''s-question-from-distress about the timing-of-the-end. Matt 11:3''s *art thou he that should come, or do we look for another?* walks the same architecture at the prison-of-the-forerunner level. Yochanan (John) had preached the prophetic-compression of the kingdom-at-hand AND the dreadful-day-of-Yahuah (the LORD) as one motion (Matt 3:7-12''s axe-at-the-root / unquenchable-fire); the motion has not landed the way he proclaimed it; the question is the gap becoming visible. The wisdom-stream had named the prophet''s-question-about-timing pattern; Yochanan (John) at Matt 11:3 walks the same legitimate-clarification-seek under the inaugurated-but-not-yet tension.'),
  ('canon', 'matthew', 11, 6, 'apocrypha', '2-esdras', 4, 34,
   '*And he answered me, saying, Do not you hasten above the most Highest: for your haste is in vain to be above him, for you have much exceeded.* 2 Esdras (4 Ezra) 4:34 names the wisdom-stream''s direct angelic-answer to the prophet''s timing-question: do not hasten above the Most High; the timing is his. Matt 11:6''s *blessed is he, whosoever shall not be offended in me* names the same disposition at the kingdom-citizens level — the blessing on the one who holds the credential, trusts the timeline, and does not fall away in the gap between the inaugurated-and-not-yet-consummated. The wisdom-stream had named the disposition the angel commended; the King at Matt 11:6 names it at the apostolic-mission level.'),
  ('canon', 'matthew', 11, 6, 'apocrypha', '2-esdras', 4, 35,
   '*Did not the souls also of the righteous ask question of these things in their chambers, saying, How long shall I hope on this fashion? when comes the fruit of the floor of our reward?* 2 Esdras (4 Ezra) 4:35 names the wisdom-stream''s direct architecture of the souls-of-the-righteous-in-their-chambers-asking-how-long. The framework reads the verse against Revelation 6:9-11''s *souls under the altar* crying *how long, O Yahuah (Lord)?* — the same pattern at the New Testament restatement. Matt 11:6''s blessing on the one who is not offended walks the same architecture: the disposition that endures the timing-gap without falling away is the disposition the wisdom-stream had named, the disposition Revelation 6 names again, and the disposition the King commends at Matt 11:6.'),

  -- Thread 2: messianic-age-restoration-in-1-enoch-and-jubilees-23
  ('canon', 'matthew', 11, 5, 'enoch', '1-enoch', 5, 7,
   '*But to the righteous and holy He will grant peace, and He will protect the elect, and compassion shall be upon them; and they shall all belong to Elohim (God), and they shall be prospered, and they shall be blessed, and the light of Elohim (God) shall shine unto them.* 1 Enoch 5:7 names the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the Messianic-age-blessing-architecture: peace to the righteous, protection of the elect, compassion, belonging-to-Elohim (God), prosperity, blessing, the light shining. Matt 11:5''s Messianic-credential answer (*the blind receive their sight, and the lame walk, the lepers are cleansed, and the deaf hear, and the dead are raised up, and the poor have the gospel preached to them*) names the operative-fact of the Messianic-age-blessing now-operating in the King''s-ministry. The wisdom-stream had named the architecture; the King at Matt 11:5 names the architecture-coming-to-pass.'),
  ('canon', 'matthew', 11, 5, 'enoch', '1-enoch', 10, 17,
   '*And then shall all the righteous escape, and shall live until they beget thousands of children, And all the days of their youth and their old age Shall they complete in peace.* 1 Enoch 10:17-22 names the wisdom-stream''s latter-day-restoration architecture explicitly: the righteous escape, beget thousands of children, complete their days in peace; the earth is tilled in righteousness, planted with trees and vines, cleansed from oppression and unrighteousness and sin; all the children of men become righteous and all nations offer adoration. Matt 11:5''s Messianic-credential answer cites the same Tanakh-prophet-cluster (Isaiah 35, 29, 26, 61) that the wisdom-stream had been carrying at the Messianic-age-restoration register. The first-coming credentialing-signs are the inaugurated-foretaste of the full latter-day restoration the wisdom-stream had named.'),
  ('canon', 'matthew', 11, 5, 'jubilees', 'jubilees', 23, 27,
   '*And the days will begin to grow many and increase amongst those children of men, Till their days draw nigh to one thousand years, And to a greater number of years than (before) was the number of the days.* Jubilees 23:27-29 names the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the latter-day-restoration: long days, peace-and-joy, no-Satan-no-evil-destroyer, days-of-blessing-and-healing. Matt 11:5''s Messianic-credentialing-signs are the inaugurated-foretaste of the same latter-day-restoration substance Jubilees had named. The wisdom-stream had named the architecture; the King at Matt 11:5 names the credentialing-arrival of the architecture in the first-coming, with the day-of-vengeance reserved for the second-coming per the deliberate-omission of Isaiah 61:2''s vengeance-clause.'),

  -- Thread 3: eliyahu-to-restore-the-tribes-in-sirach-48-and-1-maccabees-2
  ('canon', 'matthew', 11, 14, 'apocrypha', 'ecclesiasticus', 48, 10,
   '*Who were ordained for reproofs in their times, to pacify the wrath of the judgment of Yahuah (God), before it brake forth into fury, and to turn the heart of the father to the son, and to restore the tribes of Jacob.* Sirach (Ecclesiasticus) 48:10 names THE strongest wisdom-stream verbal-anchor for the Eliyahu-pattern: ordained-for-reproofs, pacify-the-wrath-of-judgment, turn-the-heart-of-the-father-to-the-son, AND *restore the tribes of Jacob* — the twelve-tribe-gathering substance the framework''s Red Line #11 names as the destination of the gathering-of-the-scattered-seed. Matt 11:14''s *if ye will receive it, this is Eliyahu (Elijah), which was for to come* identifies Yochanan (John) as the Eliyahu-pattern fulfillment; Sirach 48:10 names the same Eliyahu-pattern at the wisdom-stream register, with the *restore the tribes of Jacob* clause locking the twelve-tribe-restoration architecture as integral to the Eliyahu-mission. The framework reads Yochanan (John) as the inaugural-Eliyahu-pattern-fulfillment; the dreadful-day-of-Yahuah (the LORD) full-restoration-of-the-tribes-of-Jacob is reserved for the second-coming.'),
  ('canon', 'matthew', 11, 14, 'apocrypha', '1-maccabees', 2, 58,
   '*Elias for being zealous and fervent for the law was taken up into heaven.* 1 Maccabees 2:58 names the wisdom-stream''s witness to the Eliyahu-zealous-for-the-Torah architecture: Eliyahu''s zeal for the Torah is what the wisdom-stream remembers as the operative-substance of his mission. Matt 11:14''s Eliyahu-pattern-identification of Yochanan (John) walks the same architecture — Yochanan (John) was the wilderness-camel-hair Nazirite-disciplined prophet whose zeal for the Father''s-ways called the Pharisees and Sadducees *generation of vipers* (Matt 3:7) and whose imprisonment came from his public-condemnation of Herod Antipas''s adultery (Matt 14:3-4). The wisdom-stream had named the Eliyahu-zealous-for-Torah disposition; the inaugural-Eliyahu-fulfillment in Yochanan (John) walks the same disposition at the messenger-before-the-King''s-face register.'),

  -- Thread 4: new-heart-cleansing-spirit-children-of-the-living-in-jubilees-1
  ('canon', 'matthew', 11, 11, 'jubilees', 'jubilees', 1, 23,
   '*And after this they will turn to Me in all uprightness and with all (their) heart and with all (their) soul, and I shall circumcise the foreskin of their heart and the foreskin of the heart of their seed, and I shall create in them a holy spirit, and I shall cleanse them so that they shall not turn away from Me from that day unto eternity.* Jubilees 1:23 names the wisdom-stream''s direct Tanakh-anchor parallel to Jeremiah 31:33 and Ezekiel 36:26-27: the circumcision-of-the-heart, the creation-of-a-holy-spirit, the cleansing that does not turn away. Matt 11:11''s *he that is least in the kingdom of heaven is greater than he* (greater than Yochanan (John), the highest of the prophetic-tradition) names the kingdom-citizens'' transformation-of-status that the new-heart and the holy-spirit-creation-and-cleansing substance produces. The wisdom-stream had named the architecture at Jubilees 1:23; the King at Matt 11:11 names the operative-fact: what the prophet served from outside the indwelling-Ruach, the kingdom-citizen carries from inside it.'),
  ('canon', 'matthew', 11, 11, 'jubilees', 'jubilees', 1, 24,
   '*And their souls will cleave to Me and to all My commandments, and they will fulfil My commandments, and I shall be their Father and they will be My children.* Jubilees 1:24 names the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the new-heart-substance: souls-cleaving-to-Yahuah (God), fulfilling-the-commandments, Father-and-children-relation. The framework reads the verse against Red Line #11''s *if you hear, you are sons of Adam, you are seed of promise, you are heirs of the covenant* architecture — Jubilees 1:24''s *they will fulfil My commandments* names the inverse-of-the-false-inclusion-gospel: the covenant-children-fulfil-the-commandments because the new-heart-Spirit-cleansing-substance has been wrought in them, not because the commandment-keeping itself confers covenant-identity. Matt 11:11 names the kingdom-citizens'' transformation; Jubilees 1:24 names the substance.'),
  ('canon', 'matthew', 11, 11, 'jubilees', 'jubilees', 1, 25,
   '*And they will all be called children of the living Elohim (God), and every angel and every spirit will know, yea, they will know that these are My children, and that I am their Father in uprightness and righteousness.* Jubilees 1:25 names the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the *children of the living Elohim (God)* substance — the same phrase Hosea 1:10 names for the Lo-Ammi scattered-seed gathered home and the same phrase Paul cites at Romans 9:25-26 in the Lo-Ammi-gathered-as-sons-of-the-living-Elohim restatement. The framework reads the verse-cluster (Jubilees 1:23-25 + Hosea 1:10 + Romans 9:25-26) as one architecture: the new-heart-Spirit-cleansing substance produces the scattered-seed gathered-home as *children of the living Elohim (God).* Matt 11:11''s kingdom-citizens-greater-than-the-prophets is the operative-fact of the architecture coming-to-pass at the kingdom''s inauguration.'),

  -- Thread 5: wise-laying-in-wait-for-the-righteous-in-wisdom-of-solomon-2
  ('canon', 'matthew', 11, 19, 'apocrypha', 'the-wisdom-of-solomon', 2, 12,
   '*Therefore let us lie in wait for the righteous; because he is not for our turn, and he is clean contrary to our doings: he upbraideth us with our offending the law, and objecteth to our infamy the transgressings of our education.* Wisdom of Solomon 2:12 names the wisdom-stream''s direct prophecy of the system''s-rejection-of-the-righteous-one architecture: let-us-lie-in-wait, because-he-upbraids-us-with-our-offending-the-law. The framework reads the verse as the prophetic-pre-figuration of the Pharisaic-system''s rejection of both Yochanan (John) and Yahusha (Jesus) at Matt 11:18-19. The system''s opposite-direction-complaints (Yochanan-too-austere; Yahusha-friend-of-publicans) are cover-stories over the prior decision Wisdom 2 had named in advance — the righteous-one who reproves with the Torah is intolerable to a system invested in its own departure from it.'),
  ('canon', 'matthew', 11, 19, 'apocrypha', 'the-wisdom-of-solomon', 2, 15,
   '*He is grievous to us even to behold: for his life is not like other men''s, his ways are of another fashion.* Wisdom of Solomon 2:15 names the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the system''s-aesthetic-rejection of the righteous-one: his-life-is-not-like-other-men''s, his-ways-of-another-fashion. The framework reads the verse as the wisdom-stream pre-figuration of the *gluttonous-man, winebibber, friend-of-publicans-and-sinners* slander at Matt 11:19 — the system''s moral-character-attack on the King for the table-fellowship-with-sinners (Matt 9:10-13) is the operative-form of the system''s-aesthetic-rejection Wisdom 2:15 had named. The system''s register-of-rejection changes; the architecture does not.'),
  ('canon', 'matthew', 11, 19, 'apocrypha', 'the-wisdom-of-solomon', 2, 20,
   '*Let us condemn him with a shameful death: for by his own saying he shall be respected.* Wisdom of Solomon 2:20 names the wisdom-stream''s direct prophecy of the system''s-condemnation-of-the-righteous-one to a shameful death — the verbal-anchor for the trajectory the Matt 11:19 slander-escalation points toward (the Matt 12:24 Beelzebul-attribution, the Matt 26-27 cross-trial-and-execution). Matt 11:19''s slander is the inaugural-form of the architecture Wisdom 2:20 had named at its full terminus: the system that cannot deny the visible-fact moves through slander, moves through false-attribution, moves toward condemnation to a shameful death. The wisdom-stream had named the full architecture; Matt 11:19 names the early-step.'),

  -- Thread 6: wisdom-come-unto-me-fill-yourselves-in-sirach-24-and-baruch-3-4
  ('canon', 'matthew', 11, 19, 'apocrypha', 'ecclesiasticus', 24, 19,
   '*Come to me, all you that be desirous of me, and fill yourselves with my fruits.* Sirach (Ecclesiasticus) 24:19 names the wisdom-stream''s direct *come-unto-me* invitation-substance: wisdom-as-feminine-figure-of-the-Tanakh''s personification-tradition calling all-the-desirous to come and be filled. Matt 11:19''s *wisdom is justified of her children* closing (the inverse-of-the-system''s-rejection naming the kingdom-citizens-whose-ears-the-Father-has-opened-recognize-the-substance) walks the same wisdom-personification-tradition. The wisdom-stream had named wisdom''s come-unto-me invitation; Matt 11:19 names the children-of-wisdom who responded.'),
  ('canon', 'matthew', 11, 19, 'apocrypha', 'baruch-with-the-letter-of-jeremiah', 3, 36,
   '*He has found out all the way of knowledge, and has given it to Jacob his servant, and to Yashar''el (Israel) his beloved.* Baruch 3:36 names the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the wisdom-given-to-Yashar''el (Israel) architecture: Yahuah (God) found-out the way of knowledge and gave it to Ya''aqov (Jacob) his servant and to Yashar''el (Israel) his beloved. The framework reads the verse against Red Line #11''s scattered-seed-covenant-substance: the wisdom-given is given to the covenant-seed; the wisdom-children at Matt 11:19 are the kingdom-citizens-whose-ears-the-Father-has-opened — the covenant-seed responding to the wisdom-given. Matt 11:19''s wisdom-justified-of-her-children walks the same architecture: the wisdom-given to Ya''aqov (Jacob)-and-Yashar''el (Israel) at Baruch 3:36 is the substance the kingdom-citizens-of-wisdom recognize.'),
  ('canon', 'matthew', 11, 19, 'apocrypha', 'baruch-with-the-letter-of-jeremiah', 4, 1,
   '*This is the book of the commandments of Yahuah (God), and the law that endureth for ever: all they that keep it shall come to life; but such as leave it shall die.* Baruch 4:1 names the wisdom-stream''s direct identification of the wisdom-given-to-Yashar''el (Israel) as *the book of the commandments of Yahuah (God), and the law that endureth for ever.* The framework reads the verse as a load-bearing wisdom-stream anchor against the institutional-Christian antinomian-reading of the New Testament: the wisdom-given is the Torah; the Torah endures forever; those who keep it come to life; those who leave it die. Matt 11:19''s *wisdom is justified of her children* names the kingdom-citizens-who-keep-the-commandments-of-Yahuah (God) — the same body the 1 John 2:3-4 *keep-his-commandments-or-the-truth-is-not-in-him* filter identifies.'),

  -- Thread 7: mighty-men-mightily-tormented-in-wisdom-of-solomon-6
  ('canon', 'matthew', 11, 21, 'apocrypha', 'the-wisdom-of-solomon', 6, 5,
   '*Horribly and speedily shall he come upon you: for a sharp judgment shall be to them that be in high places.* Wisdom of Solomon 6:5 names the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the graduated-judgment-of-the-credentialed: a sharp judgment to those in high places. Matt 11:21-22''s *more tolerable for Tyre and Tsidon (Sidon) at the day of judgment, than for you* names the same graduated-judgment-architecture at the cities-that-saw-the-credential register. The wisdom-stream had named the principle: position-of-credential-or-authority brings sharper-judgment than position-without. The King at Matt 11:21-22 names the operative-application: the Galilean-cities-of-the-credentialing bear sharper-judgment than Tyre and Tsidon (Sidon) of the prophetic-indictments.'),
  ('canon', 'matthew', 11, 22, 'apocrypha', 'the-wisdom-of-solomon', 6, 6,
   '*For mercy will soon pardon the meanest: but mighty men shall be mightily tormented.* Wisdom of Solomon 6:6 names the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the graduated-accountability-by-degree-of-credentialing: mercy soon-pardons-the-meanest; the mighty are mightily-tormented. The framework reads the verse as the wisdom-stream anchor of the *more tolerable for Sodom* / *more tolerable for Tyre and Tsidon (Sidon)* architecture the King names at Matt 11:22 + 11:24. The judgment is real; the degrees are real; the degree-graduation by credentialing-density is the operative-fact the wisdom-stream had named and the King now names at the apostolic-mission level. The framework''s reading rules out both the inherited eternal-conscious-torment monolith and the universalism-flatten — the day-of-judgment is real with real-graduated-degrees.'),
  ('canon', 'matthew', 11, 23, 'apocrypha', 'the-wisdom-of-solomon', 6, 8,
   '*But a sore trial shall come upon the mighty.* Wisdom of Solomon 6:8 names the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the sore-trial-upon-the-mighty: the credentialed-and-the-mighty face the sore-trial. Matt 11:23''s *thou, Kfar-Nachum (Capernaum), which art exalted unto heaven, shalt be brought down to hell* names the operative-application: Kfar-Nachum (Capernaum) the *exalted-unto-heaven* (the King''s ministry-base, the Matt 9:1 *his own city,* the home-base of the gathering-mission) is the *mighty* upon whom the sore-trial falls. The wisdom-stream had named the principle; the King at Matt 11:23 names the cities under it. The *hell* (*hadēs* / *Sheol*, the underworld-of-the-dead) is the eschatological-judgment-station, not the inherited Christian eternal-conscious-torment overlay.'),

  -- Thread 8: sodom-as-judgment-archetype-in-jubilees-16-and-wisdom-10
  ('canon', 'matthew', 11, 23, 'jubilees', 'jubilees', 16, 5,
   '*And in this month Yahuah (God) executed his judgments on Sodom, and Gomorrah, and Zeboim, and all the region of the Jordan, and He burned them with fire and brimstone, and destroyed them until this day.* Jubilees 16:5 names the wisdom-stream''s direct Sodom-destruction-narrative as the judgment-archetype: fire-and-brimstone-destruction, until-this-day finality. Matt 11:23-24''s *more tolerable for the land of Sodom in the day of judgment, than for thee* deploys the same Sodom-as-judgment-archetype substance. The framework reads the Sodom-comparison as the King invoking the Tanakh''s-most-canonical-judgment-archetype to lock the graduated-accountability for Kfar-Nachum (Capernaum): the city-that-saw-the-credential bears greater accountability than the archetypal-judgment-city. The wisdom-stream had named the architecture; the King at Matt 11:23 names the city under it.'),
  ('canon', 'matthew', 11, 23, 'jubilees', 'jubilees', 16, 6,
   '*And, in like manner, Elohim (God) will execute judgment on the places where they have done according to the uncleanness of the Sodomites, like to the judgment of Sodom.* Jubilees 16:6 names the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the Sodom-as-judgment-archetype-for-future-applications: *like to the judgment of Sodom* names the Sodom-destruction as the template for future judgments-on-places-that-have-done-according-to-the-uncleanness. Matt 11:23-24''s *more tolerable for the land of Sodom* operates within the same architecture: Sodom is the archetype against which the Galilean-cities-of-the-credentialing are now measured at the day-of-judgment, and the credentialed-cities-who-did-not-respond face the sharper application of the Sodom-template.'),
  ('canon', 'matthew', 11, 24, 'apocrypha', 'the-wisdom-of-solomon', 10, 7,
   '*Of whose wickedness even to this day the waste land that smoketh is a testimony, and plants bearing fruit that never come to ripeness: and a standing pillar of salt is a monument of an unbelieving soul.* Wisdom of Solomon 10:7 names the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the Sodom-judgment as enduring-monument: the smoking-waste-land, the plants-bearing-fruit-that-never-come-to-ripeness, the standing-pillar-of-salt as monument-of-an-unbelieving-soul. The framework reads the verse against Matt 11:24''s *more tolerable for the land of Sodom* — Sodom is the enduring-monument the King invokes as the floor against which the Galilean-cities-of-the-credentialing are weighed. The wisdom-stream had named Sodom as the abiding-witness-to-judgment; the King at Matt 11:24 deploys the architecture to locate the cities-that-saw-the-credential at the sharper-judgment-end of the graduated-accountability-scale.'),

  -- Thread 9: the-son-of-adam-elect-one-revealing-mysteries-in-1-enoch-46-51
  ('canon', 'matthew', 11, 27, 'enoch', '1-enoch', 46, 1,
   '*And there I saw One who had a head of days, and His head was white like wool, and with Him was another being whose countenance had the appearance of a man, and his face was full of graciousness, like one of the holy angels.* 1 Enoch 46:1 names the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the Father-Son architecture at the apocalyptic-register: the One-who-had-a-head-of-days (the Father) and the Son-of-Adam-whose-countenance-had-the-appearance-of-a-man-and-whose-face-was-full-of-graciousness (the Son). Matt 11:25-27''s Father-Son revelation-economy prayer walks the same architecture at the kingdom-discourse register: the Father (*Lord of heaven and earth*) and the Son (*all things are delivered unto me of my Father; and no man knoweth the Son, but the Father; neither knoweth any man the Father, save the Son*). The wisdom-stream had named the architecture; the King at Matt 11:25-27 names it operative in his own voice.'),
  ('canon', 'matthew', 11, 27, 'enoch', '1-enoch', 46, 3,
   '*This is the Son of Adam who hath righteousness, with whom dwelleth righteousness, and who revealeth all the treasures of that which is hidden, because Yahuah (God) of Spirits hath chosen him.* 1 Enoch 46:3 names the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the Son-of-Adam-revealing-the-hidden-treasures architecture: the Son-of-Adam reveals the hidden-treasures because Yahuah (God) has chosen him. Matt 11:27''s *no man knoweth the Father, save the Son, and he to whomsoever the Son will reveal him* walks the same revelation-economy architecture explicitly. The framework reads 1 Enoch 46:3 as the wisdom-stream''s named anchor of the *son of Adam* lineage-weight (Red Line #12) restored — the title-naming case where the kaph-comparative is NOT operative; the figure is named the Son of Adam outright. The Matt 11:27 *only the Son reveals the Father* and the 1 Enoch 46:3 *the Son-of-Adam revealeth all the treasures of that which is hidden* name the same operative-fact: revelation-of-the-Father is mediated through the Son.'),
  ('canon', 'matthew', 11, 27, 'enoch', '1-enoch', 48, 6,
   '*And for this reason hath he been chosen and hidden before Him, Before the creation of the world and for evermore.* 1 Enoch 48:6 names the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the Son-chosen-and-hidden-before-the-creation-of-the-world architecture. The framework reads the verse as the wisdom-stream anchor of the Red Line #11 *names-written-before-the-foundation-of-the-world* architecture extended to the Son himself — the Son named before the creation, hidden before the Father, revealed-to-the-elect at the appointed-time. Matt 11:27''s *no man knoweth the Son, but the Father* names the unique-mutual-knowledge between the chosen-and-hidden-Son and the Father — the relational-substance the wisdom-stream had named at the apocalyptic-register restated by the King at the kingdom-discourse register.'),
  ('canon', 'matthew', 11, 25, 'enoch', '1-enoch', 48, 7,
   '*And the wisdom of Yahuah (God) of Spirits hath revealed him to the holy and righteous; For he hath preserved the lot of the righteous, Because they have hated and despised this world of unrighteousness.* 1 Enoch 48:7 names the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the revelation-economy: the wisdom-of-Yahuah (God) reveals the Son-of-Adam to the holy-and-righteous — the body that has hated-and-despised-this-world-of-unrighteousness. The framework reads the verse against Matt 11:25''s *thou hast hid these things from the wise and prudent, and hast revealed them unto babes* — the revelation-economy at the King''s prayer names the same architecture: revelation is to the un-credentialed-receptive (the babes, the holy-and-righteous-who-have-despised-this-world); concealment is from the system-credentialed (the wise-and-prudent, the world-of-unrighteousness). The Father''s sovereign-revelation-choice aligns with the substance Red Line #11''s seed-war-hearing-pattern names.'),

  -- Thread 10: mysteries-revealed-to-the-meek-in-sirach-3-and-wisdom-of-solomon
  ('canon', 'matthew', 11, 25, 'apocrypha', 'ecclesiasticus', 3, 18,
   '*The greater you are, the more humble thyself, and you shall find favour before Yahuah (God).* Sirach (Ecclesiasticus) 3:18 names the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the greatness-through-humility architecture: the greater-one humbles himself; favour comes through the humbling. The framework reads the verse as the wisdom-stream Tanakh-anchor of Matt 11:25''s revelation-economy logic: the Father reveals to the babes because the babes hold the disposition the wisdom-stream had named — humility before Yahuah (God). The system''s wise-and-prudent operate the inverse — credential-elevation rather than self-humbling — and the revelation-channel does not reach them. The wisdom-stream named the principle; the King at Matt 11:25 names the operative-fact.'),
  ('canon', 'matthew', 11, 25, 'apocrypha', 'ecclesiasticus', 3, 19,
   '*Many are in high place, and of renown: but mysteries are revealed to the meek.* Sirach (Ecclesiasticus) 3:19 names THE direct verbal-anchor for Matt 11:25 at the extras-tier: *mysteries are revealed to the meek* — the precise inverse-pair the King names at Matt 11:25 (*hid from the wise and prudent, revealed unto babes*). The wisdom-stream had named the architecture at one of its strongest direct verbal-formulations; the King at Matt 11:25 prays the same architecture into his disciples'' hearing. The *meek* of Sirach 3:19 and the *babes* (*nēpioi*) of Matt 11:25 are the same body: the *poor in spirit* of Matt 5:3, the *anawim*-disposition that has nothing to defend against the Father''s-call. The wisdom-stream and the King name one diagnostic at one register.'),
  ('canon', 'matthew', 11, 25, 'apocrypha', 'the-wisdom-of-solomon', 7, 7,
   '*Wherefore I prayed, and understanding was given me: I called upon Yahuah (God), and the spirit of wisdom came to me.* Wisdom of Solomon 7:7 names the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the prayer-as-the-channel-of-the-Spirit-of-wisdom: understanding is given to the one-who-prays; the spirit-of-wisdom comes to the one-who-calls-upon-Yahuah (God). Matt 11:25-27''s Father-Son revelation-economy walks the same architecture: the Son addresses the Father (*I thank thee, O Father, Lord of heaven and earth*) and the Father''s sovereign-revelation flows. The wisdom-stream had named the prayer-channel for the Spirit-of-wisdom; the King at Matt 11:25-27 names the prayer-channel for the Father-Son revelation-economy substance itself.'),

  -- Thread 11: put-your-neck-under-the-yoke-find-rest-in-sirach-51-and-6-and-24
  ('canon', 'matthew', 11, 28, 'apocrypha', 'ecclesiasticus', 51, 23,
   '*Draw near to me, you unlearned, and dwell in the house of learning.* Sirach (Ecclesiasticus) 51:23 names the wisdom-stream''s direct *come-unto-me* invitation-substance: draw-near, you-unlearned, dwell-in-the-house-of-learning. Matt 11:28''s *come unto me, all ye that labour and are heavy laden* walks the same invitation-substance at the kingdom-King''s register. The wisdom-stream wisdom-figure''s invitation to the unlearned is the typological-anchor of the King''s invitation to the labour-and-heavy-laden — the same body (those-bearing-the-Pharisaic-oral-tradition-burden of Matt 23:4''s *they bind heavy burdens and grievous to be borne*) the King now invites to come.'),
  ('canon', 'matthew', 11, 29, 'apocrypha', 'ecclesiasticus', 51, 26,
   '*Put your neck under the yoke, and let your soul receive instruction: she is hard at hand to find.* Sirach (Ecclesiasticus) 51:26 names THE strongest extras-tier verbal-anchor in the entire Hebrew library for Matt 11:29''s *take my yoke upon you, and learn of me.* The wisdom-stream''s wisdom-figure issues the same yoke-invitation Yahusha (Jesus) issues at Matt 11:29: put-your-neck-under-the-yoke, let-your-soul-receive-instruction. The framework''s reading of Matt 11:29 as exchange-the-Pharisaic-burden-yoke-for-the-King''s-rest-yoke (NOT yoke-vs-no-yoke) is anchored at the wisdom-stream-register here. The wisdom-figure of Sirach 51 had named the come-unto-me / put-your-neck-under-the-yoke / receive-instruction architecture; the King at Matt 11:29 walks the same architecture as the Word-made-flesh issuing the invitation in person.'),
  ('canon', 'matthew', 11, 30, 'apocrypha', 'ecclesiasticus', 51, 27,
   '*Behold with your eyes, how that I have but little labour, and have gotten to me much rest.* Sirach (Ecclesiasticus) 51:27 names THE direct verbal-anchor for Matt 11:30''s *for my yoke is easy, and my burden is light.* The wisdom-stream''s wisdom-figure names the operative-fact: little-labour, much-rest under the yoke-of-wisdom. Matt 11:30''s easy-yoke / light-burden walks the identical wisdom-stream architecture. The framework reads the verse-pair (Sirach 51:26-27 + Matt 11:29-30) as one architecture across the two registers: the wisdom-stream wisdom-yoke and the King''s heart-Torah-yoke are the same yoke-substance, and the rest-promised under both is the rest-of-walking-in-the-good-way the prophet at Jeremiah 6:16 had named.'),
  ('canon', 'matthew', 11, 29, 'apocrypha', 'ecclesiasticus', 6, 28,
   '*For at the last you shall find her rest, and that shall be turned to your joy.* Sirach (Ecclesiasticus) 6:28 names the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the wisdom-yoke-leading-to-rest-and-joy architecture in the second Sirach yoke-passage (Sirach 6:24-31): the yoke-of-wisdom looks like fetters and chains initially (vv.24-25), but at-the-last yields rest-turned-to-joy. The framework reads the verse against Matt 11:29''s *ye shall find rest unto your souls* — the rest-substance the King promises is the rest-substance the wisdom-stream had named at Sirach 6:28, and the journey from yoke-acceptance to rest-found walks the same shape: acceptance, instruction, the substance at-the-last yielding rest-turned-to-joy. The wisdom-stream had named the architecture twice (Sirach 6:24-31 + 51:23-27); the King at Matt 11:29 walks both witnesses simultaneously.'),
  ('canon', 'matthew', 11, 28, 'apocrypha', 'ecclesiasticus', 24, 19,
   '*Come to me, all you that be desirous of me, and fill yourselves with my fruits.* Sirach (Ecclesiasticus) 24:19 names the wisdom-stream''s third major *come-unto-me* invitation-passage (after Sirach 6 and 51): the wisdom-figure issues the universal-invitation *come to me, all you that be desirous of me.* Matt 11:28''s *come unto me, all ye that labour and are heavy laden* walks the same universal-invitation-architecture at the King''s register, with the labour-and-heavy-laden specifying the audience-shape the wisdom-stream''s *all you that be desirous* shares. The wisdom-stream wisdom-figure issued the come-unto-me invitation three times in Sirach (chapters 6, 24, 51); the King in Matt 11:28 issues the same invitation as the Word-made-flesh.')

)
INSERT INTO cross_references (source_verse_id, target_verse_id, source, note, tier_required)
SELECT sv.verse_id, tv.verse_id, 'manual', i.note, 'extras'::content_tier
  FROM input i
  JOIN _s140_verse_lookup sv ON sv.edition_slug = i.src_edition
                            AND sv.book_slug    = i.src_slug
                            AND sv.chapter_number = i.src_ch
                            AND sv.verse_number  = i.src_v
  JOIN _s140_verse_lookup tv ON tv.edition_slug = i.tgt_edition
                            AND tv.book_slug    = i.tgt_slug
                            AND tv.chapter_number = i.tgt_ch
                            AND tv.verse_number  = i.tgt_v
 WHERE sv.verse_id <> tv.verse_id
ON CONFLICT (source_verse_id, target_verse_id, source) DO NOTHING;

-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Insert 11 new extras-tier threads.
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------

-- Thread 1 (sort 260): prophets-question-in-the-inaugurated-tension-in-4-ezra-4
INSERT INTO cross_reference_threads (slug, title, summary_md, anchor_verse_id_start, anchor_verse_id_end, tier_required, sort_order)
SELECT 'prophets-question-in-the-inaugurated-tension-in-4-ezra-4',
       'The prophet''s question and the angel''s answer — 2 Esdras (4 Ezra) 4 on the inaugurated-but-not-yet tension',
       'Matt 11:2-3''s Yochanan (John)-from-prison question *art thou he that should come, or do we look for another?* AND Matt 11:6''s blessing on *whosoever shall not be offended in me* — read against 2 Esdras (4 Ezra) 4:33-37''s wisdom-stream architecture of the prophet''s-question-from-distress under the inaugurated-but-not-yet tension. 4 Ezra 4:33''s *how, and when shall these things come to pass? wherefore are our years few and evil?* names the prophet''s timing-question to the angel Uriel; 4 Ezra 4:34''s *do not you hasten above the most Highest* names the angel''s commendation of the trust-the-timeline disposition; 4 Ezra 4:35''s *souls also of the righteous ask question of these things in their chambers, saying, How long?* names the souls-of-the-righteous-in-their-chambers asking-how-long architecture (the same pattern Revelation 6:9-11 names at the New Testament restatement with the souls under the altar). The framework reads Yochanan''s (John''s) prison-question as the legitimate-clarification-seek of a prophet operating with the prophetic-compression now facing the inaugurated-but-not-yet gap. The wisdom-stream had named the architecture; the King at Matt 11:6 names the blessing on the disposition that endures the gap.',
       sv.verse_id, ev.verse_id, 'extras', 260
  FROM _s140_verse_lookup sv, _s140_verse_lookup ev
 WHERE sv.edition_slug = 'canon' AND sv.book_slug = 'matthew' AND sv.chapter_number = 11 AND sv.verse_number = 3
   AND ev.edition_slug = 'canon' AND ev.book_slug = 'matthew' AND ev.chapter_number = 11 AND ev.verse_number = 6
ON CONFLICT (slug) DO NOTHING;

-- Thread 2 (sort 261): messianic-age-restoration-in-1-enoch-and-jubilees-23
INSERT INTO cross_reference_threads (slug, title, summary_md, anchor_verse_id_start, anchor_verse_id_end, tier_required, sort_order)
SELECT 'messianic-age-restoration-in-1-enoch-and-jubilees-23',
       'The Messianic-age-restoration substance — 1 Enoch 5 and 10, Jubilees 23',
       'Matt 11:5''s Messianic-credential answer *the blind receive their sight, and the lame walk, the lepers are cleansed, and the deaf hear, and the dead are raised up, and the poor have the gospel preached to them* (citing Isaiah 35:5-6, 29:18-19, 26:19, 61:1) — read against the wisdom-stream''s articulation of the Messianic-age-restoration architecture. 1 Enoch 5:7-9 names the elect-blessing-substance: peace to the righteous, protection of the elect, compassion, prosperity, blessing, the light shining. 1 Enoch 10:17-22 names the latter-day-restoration: the righteous escape, beget thousands, complete their days in peace; the earth tilled in righteousness, planted with vines, cleansed from oppression and unrighteousness; all the children of men become righteous. Jubilees 23:27-29 names the long-days, the peace-and-joy, the no-Satan-no-evil-destroyer days of blessing-and-healing. The framework reads Matt 11:5''s credentialing-signs as the inaugurated-foretaste of the full Messianic-age-restoration substance the wisdom-stream had named — the first-coming substance is now-operative; the day-of-vengeance of Isaiah 61:2 is reserved for the second-coming per the deliberate-omission.',
       sv.verse_id, ev.verse_id, 'extras', 261
  FROM _s140_verse_lookup sv, _s140_verse_lookup ev
 WHERE sv.edition_slug = 'canon' AND sv.book_slug = 'matthew' AND sv.chapter_number = 11 AND sv.verse_number = 5
   AND ev.edition_slug = 'canon' AND ev.book_slug = 'matthew' AND ev.chapter_number = 11 AND ev.verse_number = 5
ON CONFLICT (slug) DO NOTHING;

-- Thread 3 (sort 262): eliyahu-to-restore-the-tribes-in-sirach-48-and-1-maccabees-2
INSERT INTO cross_reference_threads (slug, title, summary_md, anchor_verse_id_start, anchor_verse_id_end, tier_required, sort_order)
SELECT 'eliyahu-to-restore-the-tribes-in-sirach-48-and-1-maccabees-2',
       'Eliyahu ordained to restore the tribes of Jacob — Sirach 48:10 and 1 Maccabees 2:58',
       'Matt 11:14''s *if ye will receive it, this is Eliyahu (Elijah), which was for to come* identifying Yochanan (John) as the inaugural-Eliyahu-pattern fulfillment — read against the wisdom-stream''s strongest verbal-anchor for the Eliyahu-pattern with the twelve-tribe-gathering substance. Sirach (Ecclesiasticus) 48:10 names the Eliyahu-mission explicitly: *ordained for reproofs in their times, to pacify the wrath of the judgment of Yahuah (God) ... to turn the heart of the father to the son, and to restore the tribes of Jacob.* The clause *to restore the tribes of Jacob* locks the twelve-tribe-restoration architecture (Red Line #11) as integral to the Eliyahu-mission at the wisdom-stream register. 1 Maccabees 2:58 names the Eliyahu-zealous-for-the-Torah architecture: *Elias for being zealous and fervent for the law was taken up into heaven.* The framework reads Yochanan (John) as the inaugural-Eliyahu-pattern-fulfillment — messenger-before-the-King''s-first-coming, with the dreadful-day-of-Yahuah (the LORD) full-restoration-of-the-twelve-tribes reserved for the second-coming. The wisdom-stream had named the architecture with the twelve-tribe substance integrated; Matt 11:13-14 names the inaugural-fulfillment.',
       sv.verse_id, ev.verse_id, 'extras', 262
  FROM _s140_verse_lookup sv, _s140_verse_lookup ev
 WHERE sv.edition_slug = 'canon' AND sv.book_slug = 'matthew' AND sv.chapter_number = 11 AND sv.verse_number = 14
   AND ev.edition_slug = 'canon' AND ev.book_slug = 'matthew' AND ev.chapter_number = 11 AND ev.verse_number = 14
ON CONFLICT (slug) DO NOTHING;

-- Thread 4 (sort 263): new-heart-cleansing-spirit-children-of-the-living-in-jubilees-1
INSERT INTO cross_reference_threads (slug, title, summary_md, anchor_verse_id_start, anchor_verse_id_end, tier_required, sort_order)
SELECT 'new-heart-cleansing-spirit-children-of-the-living-in-jubilees-1',
       'The new heart, the cleansing spirit, and the children of the living Elohim — Jubilees 1:23-25',
       'Matt 11:11''s *he that is least in the kingdom of heaven is greater than he* (the kingdom-citizens'' transformation-of-status exceeding the highest of the prophetic-tradition) — read against Jubilees 1:23-25''s wisdom-stream Tanakh-anchor parallel to Jeremiah 31:33 and Ezekiel 36:26-27. Three direct moves: Jubilees 1:23 names the heart-circumcision and the creation of the holy-spirit and the cleansing-that-does-not-turn-away (the new-heart Tanakh-promise); Jubilees 1:24 names the souls-cleaving-to-Yahuah (God) and the fulfilling-of-the-commandments and the Father-and-children-relation (the substance of the new-heart); Jubilees 1:25 names the *children of the living Elohim (God)* designation — the same phrase Hosea 1:10 names for the Lo-Ammi scattered-seed gathered-home and the same phrase Paul cites at Romans 9:25-26. The framework reads the verse-cluster as one architecture: the new-heart-Spirit-cleansing substance produces the scattered-seed gathered-home as children-of-the-living-Elohim (God). Matt 11:11 names the operative-fact of the architecture coming-to-pass at the kingdom''s inauguration — what the prophets served from outside the indwelling-Ruach (Spirit), the kingdom-citizens carry from inside it.',
       sv.verse_id, ev.verse_id, 'extras', 263
  FROM _s140_verse_lookup sv, _s140_verse_lookup ev
 WHERE sv.edition_slug = 'canon' AND sv.book_slug = 'matthew' AND sv.chapter_number = 11 AND sv.verse_number = 11
